FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tiens, encore toi !{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Écoute un peu :
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}« {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}} arriva à {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
en un jour pluvieux et venteux... »
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}On dirait la première phrase d'un
roman d'aventures, pas vrai,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?!

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tu gambades comme un petit
enfant sous la pluie ! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Toi, tu sais
profiter de la vie, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Sieh mal einer an, wie du hier im
Regen rumläufst! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Du lässt dir nicht
den Spaß verderben,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Şuna bak, yağmurun altında koşturuyorsun! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Hayatın tadını çıkarmayı gerçekten
biliyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}OK, il fait un temps exécrable...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Mais que cela ne t'empêche pas de
profiter de ta visite,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Das Wetter ist doof, aber ich
hoffe, es gefällt dir hier trotzdem,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Yine merhaba, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Bu yağmur hayal gücünü uyandırmıyor mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Böyle havalara bayılıyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}When {{TAG:0005:0000:}} comes to visit,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} feels sunny even while
it's raining!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quand {{TAG:0005:0000:}} nous rend visite,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
le soleil brille sur {{TAG:0005:0005:}} malgré
la pluie !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quando viene a trovarci {{TAG:0005:0000:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}} splende sempre
il sole, anche se sta piovendo.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}} ziyarete gelince,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} yağmur yağarken bile güneşli
gibi oluyor!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che piani hai?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Spero che ti divertirai tantissimo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Was machst du denn so?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ich hoffe doch sehr, dass du dich
hier amüsierst, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Huhu, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Da bist du ja wieder, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Pass auf, dass du nicht zu nass
wirst, sonst erkältest du dich noch!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Aa, merhaba, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Seni yine görmek ne güzel.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Fazla yorulup ıslanmamaya dikkat et.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Direncin düşerse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} üşütebilirsin!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yine sana rastlayacağımı biliyordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ahh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} şu yağmurun sesini dinlesene!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
İnsanı ne güzel rahatlatıyor.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hello again{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Rainy nights are just so {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}magical,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
don't you think?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm glad someone else understands
how I feel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} I'm talking about you,
of course!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} yine merhaba{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Yağmurlu geceler öyle {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}büyülü{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ki,
sence de öyle değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beni anlayan birinin olması ne güzel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Elbette senden bahsediyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You're STILL out and about, hmm?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}This rain is making {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
a little chilly,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Encore en vadrouille, hein ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}L'air est
vraiment plus frais à {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
grâce à cette pluie,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Was, du bist noch immer unterwegs?
{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Der Regen macht {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
ganz schön kühl,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
It's late,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} but I love nighttime walks. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The town feels so different in the
daytime,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Still running around at this hour?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}The rain makes the night seem so
mysterious,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hi! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Immer noch unterwegs?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0003:}}Nachts
ist der Regen noch viel zauberhafter
als am Tag,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
